{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Stand is a top-down shooting game that combines light Roguelite with construction elements. You can play as a soldier by yourself or with your friends, and use a variety of weapons and props to repel endless enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ gun arsenal: from shotguns to flamethrowers, pigeon + shooting, from scraping to invincibility, directly addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 talent combinations: match different talents and weapons according to your preferences to unlock different surprise experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >86 battlefield relics: defeat various ferocious monsters, choose the relics that suit you, and experience the instantly powerful feeling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support LAN connection: pick up guns, call friends, and blow up monsters together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at any time: 10-20 minutes a game, come to an exciting lunch break adventure at any time!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769120/c8ecac7e750837169763e026d6902cc449dc3941.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Talent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769120/c7ab6d2f97bc313715733bd31c1a75a303e68bb6.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769120/940039e0b2bbccd41fe2fe2f56f1d4ff74bdf79f.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769120/3c9eca88110d447632c5e5ffa9a127c32a411fbf.jpg"},{"name":"Dominant Presence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/37